"For an illustrative report, suppose the observed matrix has 30 informative characters. Of 100 valid simulations, 12 have at least 30, 96 have at most 30, and 8 have exactly 30. The upper tail is 0.12 and the lower tail is 0.96. Ties count in both, so the two tails need not add to one. These numbers are an example, not a result for the bundled matrix." = "For an illustrative report, suppose the observed matrix has 30 informative characters. Of 100 valid simulations, 12 have at least 30, 96 have at most 30, and 8 have exactly 30. The upper tail is 0.12 and the lower tail is 0.96. Ties count in both, so the two tails need not add to one. These numbers are an example, not a result for the bundled matrix.";
