"The report lists each statistic, valid pairs, lower and upper tails, ties and simulation intervals. A small tail suggests a feature the model struggles to reproduce. Inspect that feature and the simulated matrices; there is no universal pass/fail threshold. Some statistics, such as parsimony length, compare both matrices on the same sampled tree." = "The report lists each statistic, valid pairs, lower and upper tails, ties and simulation intervals. A small tail suggests a feature the model struggles to reproduce. Inspect that feature and the simulated matrices; there is no universal pass/fail threshold. Some statistics, such as parsimony length, compare both matrices on the same sampled tree.";
